Everything else (CatalanMeasure/, CatalanMeasure.lean, Challenge.lean, Solution.lean,
comparator.json, formalization.yaml, README.md, PORTING.md, paper/, scripts/certgen/) is new work
for this project.

The general determinant lemmas and first-case dual bound were later moved, with unchanged
statements and proof bodies, from RealDeterminantUpper.lean into the new vendored file
OAI/NumberTheory/Catalan/Determinants/RealDeterminantCore.lean. Two generic denominator
lemmas from OpenAI's Case2Height namespace were also copied, with unchanged proof bodies,
into CatalanMeasure/Cert/DenominatorBounds.lean. These changes isolate reusable lemmas from
the old second-case certificate, which the current main proof supersedes.

